<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="Rates Hub">
  <data key="d0">Rates Hub</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Rates Hub is a centralized and integrated system designed to transform rate management processes by automating tasks, providing historical data, and enabling seamless integration with other platforms.&lt;SEP&gt;Rates Hub is a centralized rates management system designed to automate the process of determining, approving, and distributing deposit and index rates for various bank products.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-660938a9257fd4a4956cec1f99575be2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6794a2e6321107eae1585054a3eeba75</data>
  <data key="d4">./data/Project\Rates Hub Requirement.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1752602753</data>
</node>
<node id="Rates Committee Members">
  <data key="d0">Rates Committee Members</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Rates Committee Members are users responsible for setting, approving, and publishing rates for various bank products, including promotional and relationship-based rates.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-660938a9257fd4a4956cec1f99575be2</data>
  <data key="d4">./data/Project\Rates Hub Requirement.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1752602753</data>
</node>
<node id="Branch Bankers">
  <data key="d0">Branch Bankers</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Branch Bankers are Synovus employees who will use the Rates Hub system to access and manage rate information.&lt;SEP&gt;Branch Bankers are users who access daily rate cards tailored to their branch and region, enabling them to offer accurate rates to customers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-660938a9257fd4a4956cec1f99575be2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6794a2e6321107eae1585054a3eeba75</data>
  <data key="d4">./data/Project\Rates Hub Requirement.txt</data>
  <data key="d5">1752602753</data>
</node>
<node id="FIS Core Banking Platform">
  <data key="d0">FIS Core Banking Platform</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">FIS Core Banking Platform is a financial services platform that will integrate with the Rates Hub to manage rates in real time.&lt;SEP&gt;FIS Core Banking Platform is a financial system that requires integration with Rates Hub to access rates in real time.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-660938a9257fd4a4956cec1f99575be2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6794a2e6321107eae1585054a3eeba75</data>
